# Open an EPUB you already have

Open an EPUB file to keep working on a book you made with SEED.html, or to look inside any other EPUB.

1. On the [Books]{.ui} screen, click [Open an EPUB…]{.ui}.
2. Choose the EPUB file on your device.

The book opens and appears under [Your books]{.ui}.

A book made with SEED.html carries its own source text, so it opens ready to edit. Any other EPUB opens read-only: you can read every chapter in the preview and check it for accessibility problems, but you cannot change it.

An EPUB packaged without its source also opens read-only. To edit a book later, keep the file that [Package EPUB]{.ui} makes.
